What are zodiac signs? 
They are a series of 12 constellations that the sun, moon, and other planets move through
Of course, now due to the tilt of the earth's axis it has shifted
But, one of its main uses today is in astrology
People assign meanings to the the constellation under which you were born
While this isn't backed by science, it's always fun to track your horoscope!
Just because they are grouped doesn't mean they're not all connected (and grouping makes it easier to manage)
Check through the signs for clues!